<!--Post: 13555--><!--Time: 1115674382-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13555"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 09, 2005 - 2:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->She allegedly was thinking about a divorce in January of 2004 which has led to speculation that their marraige troubles then led to BTK resurfacing with communications in March of 2004.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13555-->
<!--Post: 13566--><!--Time: 1115706512-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13566"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Phoenix<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Phoenix<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 09, 2005 - 11:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you&#39;re going to use insanity as a defense, you&#39;re saying you don&#39;t know the difference between right and wrong.  Someone truly in that frame of mind wouldn&#39;t know whether to plead guilty or not guilty. <BR> <BR>The club the defense uses off the Tee is &#34;stand mute&#34; because a truly insane defendant doesn&#39;t know whether what they did was right &#40;not guilty&#41; or wrong &#40;guilty&#41;. <BR> <BR>Phoenix<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13566-->
<!--Post: 13567--><!--Time: 1115706711-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13567"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Phoenix<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Phoenix<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 09, 2005 - 11:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->PS <BR> <BR>Beck: <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t think insanity will work either.  I think it&#39;s the best defense, but that doesn&#39;t mean it&#39;s good, <BR> <BR>Phoenix <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13567-->
<!--Post: 13569--><!--Time: 1115707854-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13569"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Victor<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Victor<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, May 09, 2005 - 11:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Insanity&#34; will never work for DTDC. <BR> <BR>He was extremely calculating &amp; meticulous in his killings &amp; tauntings. He was a very capable University studet, home-alarm installer &amp; compliance officer who conducted very detailed, legally complicated tasks. <BR> <BR>Everything about his life in the past 31 years shows a highly intelligent, cohesive mentality who did precisely what he wanted &amp; needed at the exact times that he needed to. We&#39;re not talking about some wild, homeless, disorganized vagabond here. But instead a cold, calculating evil scumbag who knew EXACTLY what he was doing &amp; how to &#34;get away with it&#34;. <BR> <BR>Or so he thought.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
